\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {30}{\ignorespaces Decision flow for the two-step detection process including false positive recovery. The left branch shows successful refinement leading to VERIFY and operator confirmation. The right branch shows the false positive path: no re-detection during hover triggers a \SI {60}{\second } timeout, the location is added to the rejected-targets list, and the drone resumes the search pattern. Rejected locations are spatially deduplicated so the same false alarm is never investigated twice.}}{77}{figure.caption.180}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:two-step-decision-flow}{{30}{77}{Decision flow for the two-step detection process including false positive recovery. The left branch shows successful refinement leading to VERIFY and operator confirmation. The right branch shows the false positive path: no re-detection during hover triggers a \SI {60}{\second } timeout, the location is added to the rejected-targets list, and the drone resumes the search pattern. Rejected locations are spatially deduplicated so the same false alarm is never investigated twice}{figure.caption.180}{}}
